				<string>E3D70003-0000-4000-8000-000000000003</string>
				<key>steps</key>
				<array>
					<dict>
						<key>id</key>
						<string>E3D80006-0000-4000-8000-000000000006</string>
						<key>name</key>
						<string>Rigatoni</string>
						<key>text</key>
						<string>Cook the rigatoni in well-salted water until just al dente, reserving some pasta water before draining. Combine pasta and sauce, then add enough grated Pecorino that it becomes part of the sauce rather than merely a topping. Loosen with pasta water if needed. The sauce should cling aggressively to the ridges and work inside the tubes, not puddle underneath.</string>
